ys if nobody messages, encouraging real conversations and helping reduce ghosting. Smitten also adds game results directly into chats to make starting conversations easier.\n\nWhat if dating felt more like playing a game?\n\nGuessary\n\nGuess fun facts about other people and discover surprising details about their personality. A fun, effortless icebreaker.\n\nLie Detector\n\nTwo truths and a lie — you know the game. Spot the lie, challenge each other, and kick off the conversation.\n\nWavy\n\nRate hot takes on a slider, then compare answers to see whether you instantly click or lovingly disagree.\n\nUnlock Smitten Premium\n\nUpgrade your experience with premium features:\n• See who likes you\n• Undo accidental likes\n• Unlimited likes\n• Read receipts\n• Incognito mode for more privacy\n\nIt’s a wild world out there, so we’ve added tools to help keep dating comfortable and safe:\n• Pause your profile anytime\n• Control your visibility\n• Connect at your own pace\n\nJust one final piece of advice:\nDon’t settle for boring dating apps.\n\nTry Smitten.\n\nThe app is free to use. Optional premium features are available. Terms apply:\nhttps://www.websitepolicies.com/policies/view/d4cOtUMF","contentAdvisoryRating":"17+","averageUserRating":4.60059,"trackCensoredName":"Smitten - a fun dating app","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/smitten-a-fun-dating-app/id1406184928?uo=4","formattedPrice":"Free","fileSizeBytes":"109066240","userRatingCount":1367}